{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2022-12-20 16:30:00', 'title': 'FMC RECOGNIZED BY CDP FOR LEADERSHIP IN CLIMATE ACTION AND WATER STEWARDSHIP', 'text': "PHILADELPHIA , DEC. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC) FMC HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY CDP, THE GOLD STANDARD OF ENVIRONMENTAL REPORTING, AS A LEADER IN ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY, EARNING AN A- FOR CLIMATE CHANGE AND WATER SECURITY. THE SCORES REFLECT FMC'S AMBITIOUS ENVIRONMENTAL GOALS AS WELL AS THE COMPANY'S TRANSPARENCY AND MANAGEMENT OF CLIMATE-RELATED RISKS."}